  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Apple_Cows/BH_ACows_header.webp\" width=\"1131\" height=\"364\"></span></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Apple_Cows/BH_ACows_about.webp\" width=\"1131\" height=\"121\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">這個模組為遊戲新增了3種牛生物</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">它們分別是「蘋果牛」、「金蘋果牛」和「附魔金蘋果牛」</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">這些牛都生成在平原生態系中，但比普通牛更稀有</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">新增了2種小麥，可用來繁殖「金蘋果牛」和「附魔金蘋果牛」</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">遊戲中還有3種特殊道具，可將普通牛轉變為蘋果牛，</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">再將蘋果牛轉變為金蘋果牛，以此類推。</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Apple_Cows/BH_ACows_information.webp\"></span></span></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">所有蘋果牛都生成在平原生態系</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">蘋果牛可用小麥繁殖，除了掉落物外還會掉落蘋果</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">金蘋果牛可用小麥繁殖，除了掉落物外還會掉落蘋果和金蘋果</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">附魔金蘋果牛可用小麥繁殖，除了掉落物外還會掉落蘋果、金蘋果和附魔金蘋果</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Apple_Cows/BH_ACows_recipe.webp\" width=\"1131\" height=\"121\"></span></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">金小麥：</span></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/RG2JlNn.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"368\" height=\"202\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">附魔金小麥：</span></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/DPbEIIU.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"376\" height=\"197\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:24px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Apple_Cows/BH_ACows_showcase.webp\" width=\"1131\" height=\"121\"></span></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"te